Spec: Lesson entity

Purpose:
  The Lesson entity: a date, a reference to a Course and free-text details. A view-less, route-less package used by
  ../courses/courses.sdd, ../semester/semester.sdd and ../day_dialog/day_dialog.sdd.

Owns:
  ./domain.py
  ./ports.py
  ./services.py
  ./repository_sqlite.py

References:
  ../architecture.sdd

Depends on:
  ../shared/shared.sdd

Must:
  A Lesson has a date, a reference to a Course and free-text details.
  @LessonRepository in ./ports.py exposes operations to list lessons for a course or a date range and to add one.
  The table is created automatically on startup when it does not exist.

Tasks:
  [?] Decide whether a Lesson can be deleted or edited after creation, and whether more than one Lesson may exist
    for the same day and Course
  [ ] Implement @Lesson, @LessonRepository and the SQLite adapter
